# Docs screenshot: the Sprite Sheet Slicer (docs/editor/sprite-slicer.md, #45).
wait 8
key escape
click @menu:Tools
click @menu:Tools/Sprite Sheet Slicer...
wait 2
click @slicer.texture
click @pick:textures/Asteroid_2.png
wait 2
dblclick @slicer.cols
key ctrl+a
type 4
key enter
dblclick @slicer.rows
key ctrl+a
type 2
key enter
wait 1
click @slicer.cell:0
hold shift
click @slicer.cell:2
release
click @slicer.name
type spin
key enter
click @slicer.add
wait 2
annotate @slicer.mode Slice by grid or by cell size
annotate @slicer.cell:1 Picked cells, numbered in play order
annotate @slicer.add Make an animation of the picked cells
annotate @slicer.create Create an Animation Player with the animations
screenshot editor_sprite-slicer
click @slicer.cell:3
key f1
expect noderef.page == editor/sprite-slicer
